{
 "_comment": "LTX-2.3 22B: text -> video WITH natively generated audio, in one pass. This is a simplified single-pass version of the `video_ltx2_3_t2v` template (which does a 768x512 base pass, then a latent upscale + second refinement pass). Single pass is faster and enough to work with; add the upscale pass for delivery.",
 "_notes": [
  "The 22B fp8 checkpoint (29 GB) plus the Gemma-3-12B fp4 text encoder (9.4 GB) exceed 32 GB VRAM, so ComfyUI will offload between stages. Expect it to be slower than Wan for the same length.",
  "ManualSigmas on node 30 is the 8-step distilled schedule taken from the template. Do not replace it with a normal scheduler - the distilled LoRA on node 5 expects these exact sigmas.",
  "CFG is 1.0 (node 31). The model is CFG-distilled; raising it will burn the output.",
  "length must be 8n+1 (97 = 4.04s at 24fps).",
  "Audio and video are sampled as one concatenated latent (node 22), then split back apart (node 33)."
 ],
